WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.402 --> 00:00:05.291
Unit eighteen. Volunteering and Community Service!

2
00:00:06.265 --> 00:00:11.279
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Sophea. Welcome back!

3
00:00:11.329 --> 00:00:14.986
Hi, Teacher Sophea! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:15.036 --> 00:00:20.329
Today we learn: Volunteering and Community Service. Let's go!

5
00:00:21.584 --> 00:00:25.884
Volunteer. Say it with me. Volunteer!

6
00:00:29.402 --> 00:00:34.502
Community service. Say it with me. Community service!

7
00:00:38.002 --> 00:00:41.885
Donate. Say it with me. Donate!

8
00:00:45.398 --> 00:00:49.181
Charity. Say it with me. Charity!

9
00:00:52.658 --> 00:00:56.708
Give back. Say it with me. Give back!

10
00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:04.304
Support. Say it with me. Support!

11
00:01:07.807 --> 00:01:11.607
Impact. Say it with me. Impact!

12
00:01:15.109 --> 00:01:18.643
Contribute. Say it with me. Contribute!

13
00:01:22.145 --> 00:01:31.430
Grammar time! By + gerund, you can... Listen. By volunteering, you can help your community.

14
00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:37.186
Your turn. Say it with me. By volunteering, you can help your community.

15
00:01:42.206 --> 00:01:57.584
Volunteering is a great way to give back to your community. Many students contribute through community service, like helping at a charity or supporting a local shelter. Even a small donation can make a real impact when many people work together.

16
00:01:57.634 --> 00:01:59.000
I like this story!

17
00:01:59.807 --> 00:02:05.200
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:06.400
Donate!

19
00:02:07.272 --> 00:02:12.878
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:12.928 --> 00:02:14.078
Impact!

21
00:02:15.039 --> 00:02:24.959
Think and answer. Have you ever volunteered or helped your community? What did you do?

22
00:02:25.009 --> 00:02:26.159
Great answer!

23
00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:29.865
This unit's value is Generosity.

24
00:02:29.915 --> 00:02:31.960
I can show generosity every day!

25
00:02:32.668 --> 00:02:37.538
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

26
00:02:37.588 --> 00:02:39.309
Bye-bye, friends!

